    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "When you hit Bangkok, there's really only one place to go. The street is busy, full of Thai's and travelers."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 685,
        "text": "Listening to all the people talk about where they're going to go and ho great it's going to be, and I try to tell them: you can go too far, you can find out too much, but no one ever listens, no one ever listens. I guess there's some things you just have to discover for yourself."
      }
    },
